# ── Tradier credentials ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Open/fund a Tradier Brokerage account (real-time data needs a funded account).
# 2. Dashboard → Settings → API Access → create an Access Token.
# 3. Use the PRODUCTION token + base URL below for real-time data.
#    The sandbox (https://sandbox.tradier.com/v1) returns DELAYED/simulated data.
TRADIER_TOKEN=paste_your_production_access_token_here
TRADIER_BASE=https://api.tradier.com/v1
